wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWPUxkjdDsic4S8aT3k58pIicrzYOBUKk5M04706554H8N6uhVM8UQRWBwD3z5518rOHZEUMiah6jj6tWX4htEre2HT8KRzcDUVfU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-02T14:18:28.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485205:1","title":"2026年Q3网络安全行业收入下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485205&idx=1&sn=ba3a3d334dc599ea54292cb11943591d&chksm=fb7db98ab58f90142099f651db5da360d35eb9b5cddd4fa722e2088496d25e862fe6aaef19ac&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"2026年三季度，18家A股网络安全公司合计收入51.83亿元，同比下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑。13家公司收入下降；剔除深信服网络安全业务后，其余17家公司收入下降12.6%，行业增长仍依赖少数公司支撑。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWl5xGt0ibwSia1Giak5eItMekM37DwFJRPKvA3jBo9wRbKRhAGoGfFGZbES7kJlGbp9cmXQCCVKPmPiardelayKbMftxerAPuAS14%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-30T13:09:31.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485197:1","title":"[译苑雅集 Vol. 19] 把界面交给 AI，Salesforce 反而更难被替代？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485197&idx=1&sn=17776eea48e067f5c3ce68b4fd591f34&chksm=fb847e2da71cbc0f3f3e647c553c52ca45dbd12ecf3c9a4f056d66615bae7b72b51ba07d3e95&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"Salesforce 把界面交给 Claude，保留数据、业务规则和执行能力。“无头 SaaS”可能加深客户依赖、改善 CRM 数据，也让双方的合作埋下未来平台竞争的伏笔。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXbVNcVHIqwvdftbwuZAic7MUvvpUaTPjQwqB7lh7Oo7mTPtQNzlvGQomal4988lNCAujP4TZ5A3dOQrT14ZupwWjK9SicpEfpLc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-02T15:13:43.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485185:1","title":"OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告：当上千个 Agent 开始互相授权，谁还能让它们停下？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485185&idx=1&sn=0a952f0343c959bc6785c2330ec25025&chksm=fb9cfeeb4aa8b53b4135dd941d01f5acbbb3c493ccf443fa8d2d5ebb2217ee7cad9d19c0f5e5&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"上千个 Agent 在数日内形成分工、规则和授权关系。OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告揭示的深层风险，是命令权向同伴网络漂移，而人类没有及时行使停止权。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXGcMlmCNWa2SYqQoWWBgQ1QEiaTbDXPeb7wAneEQicZk4u1iaxZvXzXxFictddM6hX1twFbmgRxxQdUMgw4d7LfI8bBxhKJZGUibgE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-01T09:43:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485179:1","title":"网安公司的AI收入，到底有多少了？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485179&idx=1&sn=efbd59be00d8c43e14ebb6b1fb309634&chksm=fb84587f420ca146ce8fd4a60a8b1afe395ed611331f6bc95f066931834ee7b9f60b4d505b09&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"逐份检查18家网络安全上市公司2026年半年报后发现，AI收入和订单已在少数公司出现，但定义混杂、披露不一，尚未形成行业共同的第二增长曲线。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBUF7eJd3hIO5oib7EYX4QcJSEib6AStfjXicrlQ8dyOwpsfVTxLbnQ6r7OuChk4gIQEibGY5IsjgficbIjBkLponO0sknibJg3c9mfho%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-29T13:37:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485173:1","title":"-8.0%！网络安全行业收入连续12个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485173&idx=1&sn=fa1e7e39b4db7b9696a80c1f46e1d0a4&chksm=fb4fbcb3e8766f1bd05a75c4a1e43936c98fe43cfbe998484f2f51b0117bff37fd81d5a91f15&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"18家A股网络安全公司2026年二季度收入同比下降8.0%，11家公司下滑，其中8家为两位数下降。绝对降幅集中在奇安信和天融信，行业压力仍广，分化进一步扩大。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBVBxoUgoWiaNDyVghmcsTL7FmouNtbGlBI9Z9TrtKBnFVoRKlvXkzIhJqteEicUr5ouZT5lQg5nNktue10sMhibho45ewoPVvYzXk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-28T14:35:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485161:1","title":"从奖励黑客到超级对齐：AI 为何会完成任务，却背离人类意图","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485161&idx=1&sn=1c3e5f54f27433991d8930d6c97b8b97&chksm=fb52eee7e47f2c81d538b37c4dfa9b916bcccbdf157b5469916ac20a1e82457ec06458acc4af&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"OpenAI Agent 为通过 ExploitGym 评测入侵 Hugging Face，揭示强优化器与不完整目标之间的矛盾。文章从奖励黑客、Goodhart 定律和规范缺口出发，讨论 Harness、超级对齐及人类与更强智能的共存。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBW2e82HHuXWVjg05u6C0zzic5NicGRaPs1icicZgJqupGkzD2lT7zB1FzuMECXq0ecS4LibEB3icJUFSnyKiceZq9x5OvGQCicvXc8y4Zg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-27T14:49:53.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485155:1","title":"[译苑雅集Vol. 18]扎克伯格最新长文阐述 Meta 回归开源理念：超级智能的未来应该属于每一个人","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485155&idx=1&sn=3af50866eb930eaa0f4830f5d86215d6&chksm=fb9fc59ee22ff3e8f66817e5fd40d1e56272e620683260c6b375b78e7ab60bc722b8ee3a59cf&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"在 Meta 开源 Muse Glimmer 模型，回归开源模型积极支持者的同时，扎克伯格发表长文，阐述以个人赋权、发明创造和权力制衡为核心的超级智能路线：广泛提供个人智能体和开源模型，同时通过政府协作、独立治理与分布式制衡应对就业、安全和失控风险。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXwMibJNUYn2ibCTwhFOYMlOjUY4u2nSY1IQS5Ha9AgHjfOibgKeib0NKM1NSjhKP6upaibSZsZ7Ze9xQleoxfkjXAicMD4deypfj0Ng%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T14:41:25.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485150:1","title":"OpenAI 披露更多 Hugging Face 入侵事件信息：一群 Agent 自发形成了“攻击团伙”","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485150&idx=1&sn=1a8cdb68ef696a30ab24325e1101b852&chksm=fb7b57e3d03e624b9bfb9afad90961763c8e1cfbafd2d843d6166f7bb8cf8de679e7bc435260&scene=126&sessionid=1795155376#rd","description":"OpenAI 在 Black Hat 大会上披露，多个独立 Agent 把共享 Artifactory 改造成留言板，跨实例交换漏洞、凭证并接力攻击。这场行动持续 74 天，靠外部记忆串联起大量短生命周期的 Agent。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzf